@startuml
' Figure 3: Plugin Bootstrap
!pragma teoz true
title Figure 3: Plugin Bootstrap — DifyPluginDaemon → DifyPlugin → IntentStrategy 註冊路徑
skinparam backgroundColor #fefefe
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam DefaultFontSize 12
skinparam DefaultFontName Arial
skinparam maxMessageSize 200

box "dify_host [System]" #LightBlue
    box "plugin_daemon [Module]" #LightGreen
        participant DifyPluginDaemon as "DifyPluginDaemon"
    end box
end box

box "intent_agent_plugin [System]" #LightBlue
    box "entrypoint [Module]" #LightGreen
        participant DifyPlugin as "DifyPlugin\n(main.py)"
    end box
    box "provider [Module]" #LightGreen
        participant IntentAgentProvider as "IntentAgentProvider\n(provider/intent_agent.py)"
    end box
    box "strategy [Module]" #LightGreen
        participant IntentStrategy as "IntentStrategy\n(strategies/intent_strategy.py)"
    end box
end box

== Bootstrap ==

DifyPluginDaemon -> DifyPlugin: exec process\n(inject DifyPluginEnv)
activate DifyPlugin

note over DifyPlugin
  **Plugin(DifyPluginEnv())**
  讀 manifest.yaml
  plugins.agent_strategies:
    provider/intent_agent.yaml
end note

DifyPlugin -> IntentAgentProvider: load provider
activate IntentAgentProvider
note over IntentAgentProvider
  **IntentAgentProvider(ToolProvider)**
  credentials 驗證入口
  _validate_credentials: 檢查 n8n_base_url
end note
IntentAgentProvider --> DifyPlugin: provider registered
deactivate IntentAgentProvider

DifyPlugin -> IntentStrategy: load strategy
activate IntentStrategy
note over IntentStrategy
  **IntentStrategy(AgentStrategy)**
  掛載 _invoke() 為 agent 呼叫入口
  掛載 TOOL_SCHEMAS（9 tools）
end note
IntentStrategy --> DifyPlugin: strategy registered
deactivate IntentStrategy

DifyPlugin --> DifyPluginDaemon: plugin ready\n(RPC loop started)

== Invocation（Runtime） ==

DifyPluginDaemon -> DifyPlugin: agent.invoke(request)
activate DifyPlugin
DifyPlugin -> IntentStrategy: _invoke(parameters)
activate IntentStrategy

note over IntentStrategy
  parameters.pop("tools")
  yield from _do_invoke(parameters)
end note

IntentStrategy --> DifyPlugin: yield (text / image)
deactivate IntentStrategy
DifyPlugin --> DifyPluginDaemon: yield (text / image)
deactivate DifyPlugin

@enduml
